DE,TELETEXT64 308
PN,30801
SC,0001
PS,C000
CT,30,T
OL,0,          BTXT64  GMon 23.11.26 18:03:25
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FCommodore MPS            
OL,3,   EUltimateD]GPrinter support          
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,CPrinting a Teletext page               
OL,6, A page can be printed inFBlack & WhiteG
OL,7, Only the Commodore MPS printers are    
OL,8, supported at this moment.              
OL,10, PressBPGto print a Teletext page.      
OL,11,CYellowGborder: data is being sent.     
OL,12,ARedGborder: no printer found or error. 
OL,13, When printing is done, the border turns
OL,14, black again.                           
OL,16,CC64 Ultimate: printing to a PNG file   
OL,17, In the PRINTERS menu set:              
OL,18, - IEC printer  BEnabled                
OL,19, - Bus ID       B4                      
OL,20, - Ink density  BHigh (or Medium)       
OL,21, - Output type  BPNG B&W                
OL,23,D]F307G<<                >>F309 B]D1/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
FL,100,199,200,300,0,100
