OL,3,   EUltimateD]GPrinter support          
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,CVICE: printing to a BMP file           
OL,6, Note: Only theFWiC64 editionGwill work 
OL,7, with the VICE emulator. Read pageB306  
OL,8, for more info.                         
OL,10, Go to the settings in VICE, Peripheral 
OL,11, devices, Printer. Use these settings   
OL,12, below:                                 
OL,14,FPrinter 4:                             
OL,15, - Emulation type:BFile system          
OL,16, - Driver:        BCommodore MPS 803    
OL,17, - Output mode:   BGraphics             
OL,18, - Check:         BVirtual(bus)         
OL,20, Important: pressESend formfeedGin the  
OL,21, VICE settings screen after the print   
OL,22, job is finished (border is black again)
OL,23,D]F307G<<                >>F309 B]D2/3  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
